        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obuchele bwaNaamani bwahonibwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Naamani, omuseesia welihe liomuruchi waSiria, yali omundu omukhongo imbeli womwamiwe, nowoluyali, shichila OMWAMI yali nanyaliile Siria okhuhula abasuku; khandi yali omululu weitswoni; habula yali nobuchele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne abaSiria bali nibarulilenje tsing'anda tsing'anda; ne bali nibahambile omukhaana undi omutuutu, nibamuleera okhurula mushialo shiaIsiraeli; naye yali namutitiikhanilanga mukha Naamani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne yasunjila omukhaye tsana owa yakholelanga ari Shiakhuha omwami wanje waba nomunabii ouli eSamaria! Yakhamuhonia obuchelebwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Naamani niyeenjila naboolela omwamiwe, ari Omukhaana ulia owomushialo shiaIsiraeli uboolile ari, khandi ari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuruchi waSiria naboola mbu Chenda otsie; nasi erumile omuruchi waIsiraeli ibarwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho natsia, nali nende tsitalanda ekhumi tsieifeetsa, netsishekeli ebikhumila bisasaba tsieitsahaabu, netsingubo ekhumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayilila omuruchi waIsiraeli ibarwa tsana, eyisunga mbu Olwa ibarwa yino yilaba niyikhuulile, lola, ekhurumiile omusumba wanje Naamani, mbu omuhonie obuchelebwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa omuruchi waIsiraeli yali nasoomile ibarwa eyo, yarandula tsingubotsie, naboola mbu Nasi nisie Nyasaye noho, owakhanyala okhwira khandi okhulamusia, kho omundu oyo niyarumila omundu mbu emuhonie obuchelebwe? Nebutswa paarekhwo, mulole shinga olwa akhaaba likhuwa khwisie, okhusoolasia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olwa Elisha omundu waNyasaye yahulila shinga omuruchi waIsiraeli olwa yali naranduule tsingubotsie, yakhupila omuruchi omunwa, ari Nishiina eshichilile noranduule tsingubotsio? Lekha yeetse ewanje, mana alamanya shinga olwa aliho omunabii muIsiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Naamani natsiayo, netsifarasitsie namakaarike, nasinjila hamuliango weinzu yaElisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Elisha namurumila omurume, ari Tsia wisinje muYorodani okhuula musaafu; mana omubilikwo kulakhukalushila habwene, nosiiyikha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa Naamani nasinyikha, narulayo, nasunga mbu Lole, engaalile mbu yakharula niyanzitsila, niyeemaho, nahaabila eliira liOMWAMI Nyasayewe, nachela omukhonokwe ikulu wahabundu bwene, nambonia isie owobuchele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbula, Abana naFaripari, emialo chieDamasiko, shichishila emialo chiosi chieIsiraeli? Shindakhanyala okhwisinga muchienechio, esiiyishe? Kho nashiukhana, niyeenyokha, nalulile muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana abasumbabe nibamusitila ahambi, nibamusunjila bari Papa, khane omunabii niyakhakhubiilile mbu okhole likhuwa lindi likhongo, shiwakhakholile? Ne shiokhoyile okhukhola, olwa akhubiilile mbu Wisinje, osiiyishe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho nakholomokha, niyeeyinikha muYorodani okhuula musaafu, shinga omundu waNyasaye olwa yali nasunjile; mana omubilikwe nikumukalushila habwene, shinga omubili kwomwana omutuutu, naba omusiiyikhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana yakalukha ewa omundu waNyasaye tsana halala nabomukandakwe bosi, nibasinjila imbeiiwe; nasunga mbu Kho bulaano lola, emanyile mbu abulaho Nyasaye yesi mushialo shiosi pe, habula muIsiraeli mwonyene; khulwako chama obukule eshihaanwa shianje, isie omusumbawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye nasunga mbu Shinga OMWAMI olwa aliho mwoyo, oyo owa ekhalabanila, shindalashibukulakhwo ta. Naye namunichilisia mbu ashibukule; ne yakhaya pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Naamani nasaba mbu Kho nikaraba kario ta, ekhusaaya mbu isie omusumbawo eheebwe liloba elinyala okhuchingwa netsinyumbu tsibili. Okhuba isie omusumbawo shindalamalilanga abanyasaye bandi emisango emisambe kata emisango chindi ta, habula khuMWAMI yenyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khwikhuwa lino OMWAMI yandeshelenje isie omusumbawe; mbu olwa omwami wanje aba niyeenjila munzu yaRimoni okhwinamilamwo, niyeesiilile khumukhono kwanje, nasi nindinamila munzu yaRimoni; olwa emba nindinamila munzu yaRimoni, OMWAMI yandeshele isie omusumbawo likhuwa elo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye namusunjila mbu Otsie nomulembe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa Naamani yali namurulilekhwo hatuutu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gehazi, omusumba waElisha omundu waNyasaye, yapaara mbu Lola, omwami wanje ahonokosiye Naamani uno omuSiria, narabukula mumukhonokwe ebienebio ebia yeetsile ninabio ta; shinga OMWAMI olwa ali mwoyo, ndalamulondakhwo tsimbilo, embukulekhwo eshindu okhurula khuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Gehazi namulondakhwo Naamani. Ne olwa Naamani yalola omundu namulondangakhwo tsimbilo, yeekha okhurula mwikaarilie okhumwakaanila, nareeba mbu Kakhali karie? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye nakalusia mbu Namalayi. Ne omwami wanje yarumile, ari Lola, bulaano buno abasooliili babili abokhubaana babanabii bakhanzitsila okhurula mushialo shiebikulu shieEfuraimu; chama obaheelesie italanda ndala yeifeetsa netsingubo tsibili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naamani namusunjila mbu Khachama obukule tsitalanda tsibili. Namunichilisia, naboha tsitalanda tsibili tsieifeetsa muloloti tsibili, halala netsingubo tsibili, natsituukha abasumbabe babili, nabo nibatsichinga nibamwimiliile Gehazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa yoola khushikulu yatsibukula mumikhono chiabwe, natsibiikha munzu; naseebula abandu tsana, nabo nibeenyokha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana niyeenjila, nasinjila imbeli womwamiwe. Elisha namureeba mbu Okharula heena, Gehazi? Naye ari Omusumbawo shiatsiilekhwo habundu ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namusunjila mbu Omwoyo kwanje shikubeele nikutsiile ninawe olwa omundu ulia yashiukhana narula khwikaarilie okhukhwakaanila? Eshio shibeele eshise eshiokhubukula amapeesa, kata okhubukula tsingubo, nemikunda chiemitseituni nemitsabibu, namakondi netsing'ombe, nabakholi beshisaatsa nabeshikhasi, nohomba? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
